# Terraform working data and sensitive/generated outputs
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan
tfplan.json
plan.json
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
!*.tfvars.json.example
# Keep .terraform.lock.hcl tracked for reproducibility.

# Credentials and local configuration
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.aws/
*.pem
*.key
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# Python and local tools
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/

# Generated outputs; sanitized evidence is stored explicitly in docs/evidence/
reports/
artifacts/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
